-- A Continuous leaf under an Either or ADT constructor (task
-- writelogits-continuous-leaf-under-sum-type): each such slot is the payload's
-- (mu, sigma) given its constructor, from a component normal function
-- (main_normal_Pos_0, side_normal_left, ...). Exact vectors are pinned in
-- TestWriteLogitsProperties' continuousUnderSum group; here the endpoints feed
-- WriteLogitsRoundtrip's DensityAgreement. opt's Present arm is dead at True.
-- main: [mu|x, sigma|x, mu|y, sigma|y]
-- side: [P(Left), mu|Left, sigma|Left, P(True|Right), P(False|Right)]
-- opt:  [P(Absent), P(Present), mu|Present, sigma|Present]
data Pos = Pos x::Float, y::Float
data Opt = Absent | Present w::Float
main = Pos (Normal * 2.0) (Normal + 1.0)
side = if Uniform < 0.25 then left (Normal * 3.0) else right True
opt b = if b then Absent else Present (Normal + 1.0)
